rpmane", tag="Optional", desc="Pick any of the three breadcrumbs or get Taming the Beast from Yaw Sharpmane."}, [150]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane"}, [151]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame an Adult Plainstrider. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Yaw Sharpmane in Bloodhoof Village."}, [152]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane"}, [153]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane"}, [154]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame a Prairie Stalker. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Yaw Sharpmane in Bloodhoof Village."}, [155]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane"}, [156]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane"}, [157]={hint="Use the Taming Rod to tame a Swoop. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Yaw Sharpmane in Bloodhoof Village."}, [158]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane"}, [159]={npc="Yaw Sharpmane", tgt="Yaw Sharpmane", desc="After all three tames, train pet skills on Hunter Rise in Thunder Bluff."}, [160]={hint="Speak with Holt Thunderhorn on Hunter Rise in Thunder Bluff.", desc="After all three tames, train pet skills on Hunter Rise in Thunder Bluff."}, [161]={npc="Holt Thunderhorn", tgt="Holt Thunderhorn", desc="After all three tames, train pet skills on Hunter Rise in Thunder Bluff."}, [162]={npc="Gennia Runetotem", tgt="Gennia Runetotem", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or pick up Moonglade from Turak Runetotem."}, [163]={hint="Speak with Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise of Thunder Bluff.", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or pick up Moonglade from Turak Runetotem."}, [164]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or pick up Moonglade from Turak Runetotem."}, [165]={npc="Innkeeper Pala", tgt="Innkeeper Pala", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or pick up Moonglade from Turak Runetotem."}, [166]={hint="Speak with Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise of Thunder Bluff.", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or pick up Moonglade from Turak Runetotem."}, [167]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or pick up Moonglade from Turak Runetotem."}, [168]={npc="Innkeeper Gryshka", tgt="Innkeeper Gryshka", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or pick up Moonglade from Turak Runetotem."}, [169]={hint="Speak with Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise of Thunder Bluff.", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or pick up Moonglade from Turak Runetotem."}, [170]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem", tag="Optional", desc="Do any of the three lead-ins, or pick up Moonglade from Turak Runetotem."}, [171]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem", desc="Learn the teleport from Turak Runetotem, then use it to reach Moonglade."}, [172]={hint="Use the spell \"Teleport: Moonglade\" to travel to Moonglade. When you arrive, speak with Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven.", desc="Learn the teleport from Turak Runetotem, then use it to reach Moonglade."}, [173]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze", desc="Learn the teleport from Turak Runetotem, then use it to reach Moonglade."}, [174]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze", desc="Talk to Great Bear Spirit to the northwest, then return to Nighthaven."}, [175]={hint="Seek out the Great Bear Spirit in northwestern Moonglade and learn what it has to share with you about the nature of the bear. When finished, return to Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven, Moonglade.", desc="Talk to Great Bear Spirit to the northwest, then return to Nighthaven."}, [176]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze", desc="Talk to Great Bear Spirit to the northwest, then return to Nighthaven."}, [177]={npc="Dendrite Starblaze", tgt="Dendrite Starblaze"}, [178]={hint="Return to Thunder Bluff and speak with Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise."}, [179]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem"}, [180]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem"}, [181]={hint="Use the Cenarion Lunardust on the Moonkin Stone between Mulgore and the Barrens to bring forth Lunaclaw. From there, you must face Lunaclaw and earn the strength of body and heart it possesses."}, [182]={npc="Turak Runetotem", tgt="Turak Runetotem"}, [183]={text="Follow the road north to the Crossroads. Learn Devrak's flight path (51.50, 30.34) and set your hearth with Innkeeper Boorand Plainswind (51.99, 29.89)."}}},
    ["01-5"] = {name="Deathknell", tips={{k="交通", text="Coming from another starting zone? Get off at the zeppelin tower south of Brill and follow the road west to Deathknell. See the travel notes above."}, {k="提醒", text="Start with Rude Awakening inside the crypt (Undead only). Pick up The Mindless Ones from Shadow Priest Sarvis (30.84, 66.20). If he has no quest, follow the road to Brill.", s={{"Start with Rude Awakening inside the crypt (Undead only)", {race={"Scourge"}}}, {"Pick up The Mindless Ones from Shadow Priest Sarvis (30.84, 66.20)"}, {"If he has no quest, follow the road to Brill"}}}, {k="提醒", text="Grind Rattlecage Skeletons to level 3, then accept Marla's Last Wish. Head to Brill at level 6 or once you finish this section.", s={{"Grind Rattlecage Skeletons to level 3, then accept Marla's Last Wish"}, {"Head to Brill at level 6 or once you finish this section"}}}}, danger={[1]="The narrow tunnel in Night Web's Hollow can pull spider packs from both sides. Clear the entrance before going in."}, grind={[1]={mob="Wretched Zombie", note="Dense, mostly neutral normal mobs north of Deathknell. Pull singles during The Mindless Ones at levels 1-2."}, [2]={mob="Night Web Spider", note="Dense normal mobs inside Night Web's Hollow. Clear in stages from the entrance to avoid extra pulls. Pair with the cave quests."}, [3]={mob="Scarlet Initiate", note="Dense normal mobs at the eastern Scarlet camp. Clear along the edge to avoid pulling zealots. Pair with the armband quest."}}, supply={[1]={npc="Blacksmith Rand"}, [2]={npc="Joshua Kien"}, [3]={npc="Joshua Kien"}}, steps={[1]={npc="Undertaker Mordo", tgt="Undertaker Mordo"}, [2]={hint="Speak with Shadow Priest Sarvis."}, [3]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis"}, [4]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis"}, [5]={hint="Shadow Priest Sarvis wants you to kill 8 Mindless Zombies and 8 Wretched Zombies."}, [6]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis"}, [7]={npc="Novice Elreth", tgt="Novice Elreth"}, [8]={hint="Novice Elreth requires 6 Scavenger Paws and 6 Duskbat Wings."}, [9]={npc="Novice Elreth", tgt="Novice Elreth"}, [10]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis"}, [11]={npc="Deathguard Saltain", tgt="Deathguard Saltain"}, [12]={npc="Executor Arren", tgt="Executor Arren"}, [13]={npc="Novice Elreth", tgt="Novice Elreth"}, [14]={npc="Aramis Hammerhand", tgt="Aramis Hammerhand"}, [15]={hint="Kill 12 Rattlecage Skeletons, and then return to Shadow Priest Sarvis in Deathknell when you are done."}, [16]={hint="Search Deathknell and the vicinity for 6 pieces of Scavenged Goods, and return them to Deathguard Saltain."}, [17]={hint="Executor Arren wants you to kill 10 Young Night Web Spiders and 8 Night Web Spiders."}, [18]={hint="Bring Samuel Fipps' Remains to Marla's Grave, then return to Novice Elreth."}, [19]={hint="Free 6 Webbed Victims in Night's Web Hollow for Aramis Hammerhand in Deathknell."}, [20]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis"}, [21]={npc="Deathguard Saltain", tgt="Deathguard Saltain"}, [22]={npc="Executor Arren", tgt="Executor Arren"}, [23]={npc="Novice Elreth", tgt="Novice Elreth"}, [24]={npc="Aramis Hammerhand", tgt="Aramis Hammerhand"}, [25]={npc="Executor Arren", tgt="Executor Arren"}, [26]={hint="Bring Executor Arren 12 Scarlet Armbands from Scarlet Converts and Scarlet Initiates."}, [27]={npc="Executor Arren", tgt="Executor Arren"}, [28]={npc="Executor Arren", tgt="Executor Arren"}, [29]={hint="Kill Meven Korgal, the messenger, at the Crusader camp, then return any information you find to Executor Arren."}, [30]={npc="Executor Arren", tgt="Executor Arren"}, [31]={npc="Executor Arren", tgt="Executor Arren"}, [32]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis", desc="Turn in The Mindless Ones first. Alt. Pickup: Novice Elreth (30.86, 66.05)."}, [33]={hint="Read the Consecrated Scroll and speak to Aramis Hammerhand in the church in Deathknell.", desc="Turn in The Mindless Ones in Deathknell first."}, [34]={npc="Aramis Hammerhand", tgt="Aramis Hammerhand", desc="Turn in The Mindless Ones in Deathknell first."}, [35]={npc="Aramis Hammerhand", tgt="Aramis Hammerhand", desc="Turn in The Mindless Ones before leaving Deathknell."}, [36]={hint="Heal 5 Injured Deathguard with your Holy Light ability.", desc="Turn in The Mindless Ones before leaving Deathknell."}, [37]={npc="Aramis Hammerhand", tgt="Aramis Hammerhand", desc="Turn in The Mindless Ones before leaving Deathknell."}, [38]={npc="Aramis Hammerhand", tgt="Aramis Hammerhand", desc="Turn in Rediscovering the Light first."}, [39]={hint="Find the Frightened Paladin in Deathknell.", desc="Turn in Rediscovering the Light first."}, [40]={npc="Aramis Hammerhand", tgt="Aramis Hammerhand", desc="Turn in Rediscovering the Light first."}, [41]={npc="Aramis Hammerhand", tgt="Aramis Hammerhand", desc="Accept before leaving Deathknell. Turn in on arrival in Brill."}, [42]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis", desc="Finish The Mindless Ones, then take the breadcrumb from your class trainer."}, [43]={hint="Read the Simple Scroll and speak to Dannal Stern in Deathknell.", desc="Finish The Mindless Ones, then take the breadcrumb from your class trainer."}, [44]={npc="Dannal Stern", tgt="Dannal Stern", desc="Finish The Mindless Ones, then take the breadcrumb from your class trainer."}, [45]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis", desc="Finish The Mindless Ones, then take the breadcrumb from your class trainer."}, [46]={hint="Read the Encrypted Scroll and speak to David Trias in Deathknell.", desc="Finish The Mindless Ones, then take the breadcrumb from your class trainer."}, [47]={npc="David Trias", tgt="David Trias", desc="Finish The Mindless Ones, then take the breadcrumb from your class trainer."}, [48]={npc="Shadow Priest Sarvis", tgt="Shadow Priest Sarvis"}, [49]={hint="Read the Tainted Scroll and speak to Maximillion in Deathknell."}, [50]={npc="Maximillion", tgt="