re from the ruined tower south of Brill."}, [190]={npc="Carendin Halgar", tgt="Carendin Halgar", desc="Get Egalin's Grimoire from the ruined tower south of Brill."}, [191]={npc="Carendin Halgar", tgt="Carendin Halgar", desc="Use the rune at the Magic Quarter summoning circle and defeat the Voidwalker."}, [192]={hint="Using the Runes of Summoning, summon and subdue a voidwalker, then return the Runes of Summoning to Carendin Halgar in the Magic Quarter of the Undercity.", desc="Use the rune at the Magic Quarter summoning circle and defeat the Voidwalker."}, [193]={npc="Carendin Halgar", tgt="Carendin Halgar", desc="Use the rune at the Magic Quarter summoning circle and defeat the Voidwalker."}, [194]={npc="Dark Cleric Beryl", tgt="Dark Cleric Beryl", desc="Train Lesser Heal (Rank 2) and Power Word: Fortitude first."}, [195]={hint="Find Deathguard Kel and heal his wounds using Lesser Heal (Rank 2). Afterwards, grant him Power Word: Fortitude and then return to Dark Cleric Beryl in Brill.", desc="Train Lesser Heal (Rank 2) and Power Word: Fortitude first."}, [196]={npc="Dark Cleric Beryl", tgt="Dark Cleric Beryl", desc="Train Lesser Heal (Rank 2) and Power Word: Fortitude first."}, [197]={npc="Aelthalyste", tgt="Aelthalyste"}, [198]={hint="Complete the quest objectives."}, [199]={npc="Aelthalyste", tgt="Aelthalyste"}, [200]={npc="Cain Firesong", tgt="Cain Firesong"}, [201]={hint="Speak with Anastasia Hartwell."}, [202]={npc="Anastasia Hartwell", tgt="Anastasia Hartwell"}, [203]={npc="Anastasia Hartwell", tgt="Anastasia Hartwell"}, [204]={hint="Bring Balnir Snapdragons to Anastasia Hartwell in the Mage Quarter of the Undercity."}, [205]={npc="Anastasia Hartwell", tgt="Anastasia Hartwell"}, [206]={text="Board the Orgrimmar zeppelin at Zapetta's west platform southeast of Brill (60.74, 58.87). Get off at the south platform of the east tower outside Orgrimmar (50.82, 13.54)."}, [207]={text="Enter Orgrimmar and learn Doras's flight path (45.12, 63.89). Fly to the Crossroads